{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/2/0526e1f5ad1412706cf938657f754604e672a671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XYZ$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> are similar, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804e4cf2a90e4c07c1ee1c22956da07515d41714.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=3, BC=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d3384735ffc8115e763ed4847035e708c782d9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY=5$\" width=\"64\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/a/3aab17e2f2005ca643854186430099294ad84b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$YZ$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4fe476b9af1d05efe88d99fb2e943cb3cc0c65e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 3\\frac{3}{4} \\qquad  \\text{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad  \\text{(C)}\\ 6\\frac{1}{4} \\qquad  \\text{(D)}\\ 6\\frac{2}{3} \\qquad  \\text{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"369\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the triangles are similar, we know that the corresponding sides of the triangle are in ratio to each other. \nWe have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/2/322d96aaa082d77317b7f87b761a76af0a3e910f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\overline{AB}}{\\overline{XY}}=\\frac{\\overline{BC}}{\\overline{YZ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"90\" height=\"42\" />. Plugging in values we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd397a7894377e5a3dd672ca97bc0c20057ba24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{5}{\\overline{YZ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"68\" height=\"39\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1817c383636a4e8f30eb3ebb5c8a26dd172742.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{YZ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b2877362d5d6b252a35b4473c13c474e9f92c41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{YZ}=6\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"73\" height=\"37\" />. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•<